STEP 1: Configure Webhook in GitHub
1. Open your GitHub Repository → Settings → Webhooks
2. Click “Add Webhook”

Fill the form:

Field	Value
Payload URL	http://<your-public-url>/github-webhook/
Example (if using ngrok):	http://1234abcd.ngrok.io/github-webhook/
Content type	application/json
Secret	(leave empty unless using one)
Events	Choose: Just the push event
Click: Add Webhook
